@baseUrl = {{$dotenv BE_BASE_URL}}/api
@jwtToken = {{$dotenv JWT_TOKEN}}

### Banner of /fun: next or live arena, counts, rules, whether I registered
GET {{baseUrl}}/arena/banner
Authorization: Bearer {{jwtToken}}

### "Nhắc tôi" (register) and take it back
POST {{baseUrl}}/arena/register
Authorization: Bearer {{jwtToken}}

###
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/arena/register
Authorization: Bearer {{jwtToken}}

### Lobby (the call also marks me as "in the room" once the room is open)
POST {{baseUrl}}/arena/lobby
Authorization: Bearer {{jwtToken}}

### Question N of today's arena (the right answer only after it ends)
GET {{baseUrl}}/arena/question?sessionId=1&qNo=1
Authorization: Bearer {{jwtToken}}

### Answer (option = shown position 0-3)
POST {{baseUrl}}/arena/answer
Authorization: Bearer {{jwtToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "sessionId": 1, "qNo": 1, "option": 0 }

### Leaderboard of a day (no sessionId = the latest finished one)
GET {{baseUrl}}/arena/board
Authorization: Bearer {{jwtToken}}
